# scripts/real_client_markers.txt.example
#
# This is a committed TEMPLATE only. It documents the input format that
# scripts/scan_for_real_client_trace.sh expects at scripts/real_client_markers.txt
# (an untracked, gitignored file that is never committed to this repository).
#
# Format:
#   - One extended-regex (grep -E) pattern per line.
#   - Blank lines are ignored.
#   - Lines whose first non-space character is '#' are treated as comments and ignored.
#   - Patterns are matched case-insensitively across the whole tree (excluding .git and
#     data/), so no case variants need to be listed separately.
#
# The patterns below are obviously-fictional samples for format illustration only — they
# do not correspond to any real identifier used by this project. Supply your own
# scripts/real_client_markers.txt locally with the actual patterns you need to guard
# against; this scanner fails closed (exit 2) if that file is absent or empty.

example-fictional-brand-name
example-fictional-owner-name
\+000 000 0000
